WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:02.170
- [Narrator] These
paintings, they aren't done

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:04.920
with acrylic, oil, or watercolor.

00:00:08.002 --> 00:00:11.464
- [Narrator] Microsoft
Excel, the computer program.

00:00:11.464 --> 00:00:15.842
This is a story about Tatsuo,
the Microsoft Excel Artist.

00:00:15.842 --> 00:00:19.342
(bouncy electronic music)

00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:29.101
- [Narrator] When Tatsuo
retired, he decided

00:00:29.101 --> 00:00:33.268
he wanted to paint, but there
was one problem: he was cheap.

00:00:46.292 --> 00:00:48.887
- [Narrator] He didn't even
want to pay for an art program,

00:00:48.887 --> 00:00:52.554
so he used what was
already on his computer.

00:01:01.977 --> 00:01:03.908
- [Narrator] So, how do you paint in Excel?

00:01:03.908 --> 00:01:06.794
The line tool, it's usually
used for spreadsheet graphs,

00:01:06.794 --> 00:01:10.036
that you can make trees
with, and the bucket tool,

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:13.137
it helps with subtle
shading on, for example,

00:01:13.137 --> 00:01:15.054
the crest of a volcano.

00:02:19.176 --> 00:02:21.843
(bell dinging)

